  ('Precious Black', 'precious-black', 75000, 'Deep charcoal and rich espresso tones are layered with fine mineral veining, creating a surface full of depth and character. Precious Black brings a sophisticated, dramatic feel to contemporary luxury interiors.', 'Deep charcoal and rich espresso tones are layered with fine mineral veining, creating a surface full of depth and character.', '{"Slab size": "3200 x 1600 x 12mm", "Thickness": "12mm", "Finish": "3D Digital", "Body composition": "Super Black Speckled Body", "Recommended for": "Kitchen countertops, islands, vanity tops, feature walls and reception areas"}', 'one_face', '12MM SINTERED STONES/PRECIOUS BLACK'),
  ('Pure White', 'pure-white', 65000, 'A beautifully clean, bright-white surface with an almost seamless appearance. Pure White is the ultimate choice for minimalist interiors, creating a fresh and timeless foundation that allows the architecture and furnishings to take centre stage.', 'A beautifully clean, bright-white surface with an almost seamless appearance.', '{"Slab size": "3200 x 1600 x 12mm", "Thickness": "12mm", "Finish": "Soft Matte", "Body composition": "Super White Body", "Recommended for": "Kitchen countertops, islands, vanity tops, feature walls and reception areas"}', 'one_face', '12MM SINTERED STONES/PURE WHITE'),
  ('Rome Phantom Ivory', 'rome-phantom-ivory', 75000, 'Soft cloud-like movement and subtle travertine-inspired veining flow across a warm ivory background. Rome Phantom Ivory brings a relaxed sense of elegance and natural warmth to contemporary spaces.', 'Soft cloud-like movement and subtle travertine-inspired veining flow across a warm ivory background.', '{"Slab size": "3200 x 1600 x 12mm", "Thickness": "12mm", "Finish": "3D Digital", "Body composition": "Super White Body", "Recommended for": "Kitchen countertops, islands, vanity tops, feature walls and reception areas"}', 'book_match', '12MM SINTERED STONES/ROME PHANTOM IVORY'),
  ('Sabnis', 'sabnis', 75000, 'A deep midnight-black background is crossed by dramatic white veins that move like flashes of light. Sabnis is bold, luxurious and unmistakable, and it is made for statement islands, feature walls and interiors designed to command attention.', 'A deep midnight-black background is crossed by dramatic white veins that move like flashes of light.', '{"Slab size": "3200 x 1600 x 12mm", "Thickness": "12mm", "Finish": "Grip", "Body composition": "Super Black Full Body", "Recommended for": "Kitchen countertops, islands, vanity tops, feature walls and reception areas"}', 'one_face', '12MM SINTERED STONES/SABNIS'),
  ('Sandstone Beige', 'sandstone-beige', 75000, 'Soft diagonal grains flow across a warm nude-beige background, creating the natural movement of French sandstone. Sandstone Beige adds warmth and texture while maintaining a clean, sophisticated look.', 'Soft diagonal grains flow across a warm nude-beige background, creating the natural movement of French sandstone.', '{"Slab size": "3200 x 1600 x 12mm", "Thickness": "12mm", "Finish": "3D Digital", "Body composition": "Beige Body", "Recommended for": "Kitchen countertops, islands, vanity tops, feature walls and reception areas"}', 'one_face', '12MM SINTERED STONES/SANDSTONE BEIGE'),
